==Esperanto==

===Etymology===
From {{af|eo|ki-|pos1=interrogative and relative [[:Category:Esperanto correlatives|correlative]] prefix|-a|pos2=correlative suffix of kind|nocat=1}}.

===Pronunciation===
{{eo-IPA|a=Eo-kia.ogg}}

===Determiner===
{{eo-det}}

# what kind of, which kind of (the interrogative and relative correlative of kind)
#: {{ux|eo|Mi ne scias kian koloron almeti por la ĉielo.|I do not know what kind of color to put on for the sky.}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|eo|kia ajn|gloss=whatever kind of}}

===Usage notes===
Like other interrogative and relative correlatives, '''kia''' can be combined with {{m|eo|ajn}}, the adverbial particle of generality. '''''Kia''' ajn'' thus means ''whatever kind of''.

{{eo BRO|1}}
{{eo GCSE|0}}

